            {
                "entry_id": "eacbbe50-e3d2-3fbd-a16a-bebcac2441d3",
                "word": "caddie",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "de6360fc-e9f6-4e4b-8268-688960632ec5",
                        "entry_id": "eacbbe50-e3d2-3fbd-a16a-bebcac2441d3",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "caddies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "40a65820-4e9d-38b6-9296-ea3be7e557c8",
                        "entry_id": "eacbbe50-e3d2-3fbd-a16a-bebcac2441d3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Synonym of cadet (“a gentleman (often a younger son from a noble family) who joined the military without a commission as a career”)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Scotland",
                            "also",
                            "attributive",
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b76af762-03cd-3fb6-a81a-74fe4220dc9a",
                        "entry_id": "eacbbe50-e3d2-3fbd-a16a-bebcac2441d3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A young man; a boy, a lad; specifically (derogatory), one regarded as of low social status; a ragamuffin."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Scotland",
                            "archaic",
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e06ad347-b442-4a00-8630-c29fac997719",
                                "sense_id": "b76af762-03cd-3fb6-a81a-74fe4220dc9a",
                                "text": "But gie him't het, my hearty cocks! / E'en cowe the cadie!"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a411e3ed-b00b-3d03-8170-6f1004ba278e",
                        "entry_id": "eacbbe50-e3d2-3fbd-a16a-bebcac2441d3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person engaged to run errands such as carrying goods and messages; a commissionaire, an errand boy or errand girl, a gofer; specifically, a member of an organized group of such persons working in large Scottish cities and towns in the early 18th century."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Scotland",
                            "broadly",
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "225b500e-4168-415a-8daf-640c2e0bc319",
                                "sense_id": "a411e3ed-b00b-3d03-8170-6f1004ba278e",
                                "text": "A tattered cadie, or errand porter, whom David Deans had jostled in his attempt to extricate himself from the vicinity of the scorners, exclaimed in a strong north-country tone, \"Ta de'il ding out her Cameronian een—what gi'es her titles to dunch gentlemans about?\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bd715b45-df7b-49cf-b238-078f8c0b8374",
                                "sense_id": "a411e3ed-b00b-3d03-8170-6f1004ba278e",
                                "text": "There would be a prosperity such as might seem fabulous, a prosperity of which every Scotchman, from the peer to the cadie, would partake."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7cb9f3a5-03d4-32af-872f-b32b31cd8e95",
                        "entry_id": "eacbbe50-e3d2-3fbd-a16a-bebcac2441d3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person hired to assist a golfer by carrying their golf clubs and providing advice."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "also",
                            "attributive",
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "766b7691-ed30-4e8e-bd74-3fa40270e48d",
                                "sense_id": "7cb9f3a5-03d4-32af-872f-b32b31cd8e95",
                                "text": "As caddy I had to carry the clubs, for there are four varieties almost everyone used, and some used more. Besides doing this, the caddy has to keep score of the number of strokes used, and watch and find each ball."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab9037bf-0e16-4a3a-bebb-404daa63fffa",
                                "sense_id": "7cb9f3a5-03d4-32af-872f-b32b31cd8e95",
                                "text": "Then Carter Chapman picked out his putter, stepped confidently up to the ball, sighted once along the ground, and made his stroke. The ball rolled straight as a die toward the caddy who was holding the flag, and tinkled into the cup for a birdie three!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dfcb578b-8dfb-487b-b162-293d3f3c5494",
                        "source_entry_id": "eacbbe50-e3d2-3fbd-a16a-bebcac2441d3",
                        "source_sense_description": "person hired to assist a golfer by carrying their golf clubs and providing advice",
                        "target_lang_word": "caddie",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "caddie",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "657440f7-165f-3343-998e-1a0b01f0b2b8",
                                        "entry_id": "ae880848-1796-3d49-a651-96993ddf04e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "iemand die de clubs draagt en soms ook raad kan geven aan de speler"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "beroep",
                                            "golf"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3dd3aee7-4d7a-42aa-bf89-1a171193567d",
                                                "sense_id": "657440f7-165f-3343-998e-1a0b01f0b2b8",
                                                "text": "Een caddie moet volgens hem over een goed karakter beschikken, fit zijn en uiteraard kennis van golf hebben."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b2e7d7c3-82da-303f-b82f-bb3b72b490d0",
                                        "entry_id": "ae880848-1796-3d49-a651-96993ddf04e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(golf) koker of wagentje waarin de clubs worden meegedragen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24a6aefd-e432-4239-aa20-4c3fb9073558",
                                                "sense_id": "b2e7d7c3-82da-303f-b82f-bb3b72b490d0",
                                                "text": "In de uitzending van het programma gaan er allerlei dingen mis tijdens een golfsessie, waarbij Maradona flink in het ootje wordt genomen. De Argentijn kan er niet om lachen, met een vedette valt immers niet te sollen. Hij rijdt boos weg in een caddie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0113f51f-a40b-3f2d-b2ab-dc1fd01cb491",
                                        "entry_id": "ae880848-1796-3d49-a651-96993ddf04e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "rolwagentje voor boodschappen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "277afaae-92be-4426-a3c8-efbbf504717e",
                                                "sense_id": "0113f51f-a40b-3f2d-b2ab-dc1fd01cb491",
                                                "text": "Na een tip van een alerte burger heeft een patrouille van de lokale politie op de Bruul in Mechelen een winkeldief kunnen vatten. Hij wandelde rond met een caddie waarin een groot aantal gestolen kledingstukken zaten."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "384243d4-7774-4073-9e1a-9b3c286a386e",
                                                "sense_id": "0113f51f-a40b-3f2d-b2ab-dc1fd01cb491",
                                                "text": "Welke Nederlander verstaat de zin: „Abigail laadt haar caddie vol met brikken melk en brol”? Volgens mijn Nederlandse corrector: geen enkele. En dus laadt Abigail nu haar rolwagentje vol met kartonnen melk en rommel."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "541d0e3b-8501-47cb-b29a-9525170daa7c",
                        "source_entry_id": "eacbbe50-e3d2-3fbd-a16a-bebcac2441d3",
                        "source_sense_description": "person hired to assist a golfer by carrying their golf clubs and providing advice",
                        "target_lang_word": "caddie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "caddie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "962479aa-d8f0-3419-b982-d7e6a55bf470",
                                        "entry_id": "f906dc6f-070c-38ef-a014-0db5645dfef9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne chargée de transporter le matériel, d’accompagner et de conseiller les golfeurs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8b9dc32-cbed-4ac3-b703-d6c1ecbed585",
                                                "sense_id": "962479aa-d8f0-3419-b982-d7e6a55bf470",
                                                "text": "Il souriait en me confiant qu’il était très demandé comme caddie, à cause de la rapidité avec laquelle il retrouvait les balles perdues : « Pas difficile, j’en avais plein mes poches ! »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e086a71-b872-43a6-87d0-a33a2a093075",
                                                "sense_id": "962479aa-d8f0-3419-b982-d7e6a55bf470",
                                                "text": "Le temps d’une journée Tiger Woods a changé de costume pour devenir le caddie de son fils."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d9df9a9e-c70f-374a-86a5-b263568d9863",
                                        "entry_id": "f906dc6f-070c-38ef-a014-0db5645dfef9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Voiturette pour le transport du matériel de golf et des golfeurs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1f26087-91d4-4b0e-b2a4-c1d58695db81",
                                                "sense_id": "d9df9a9e-c70f-374a-86a5-b263568d9863",
                                                "text": "Le véhicule de la taille d’un caddie de golf lancé sur Mars en juin 2003, qui a atterri en janvier 2004, était supposé survivre trois mois."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "10d5ac95-9a9b-3264-b1dd-8346221e1133",
                                        "entry_id": "f906dc6f-070c-38ef-a014-0db5645dfef9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Chariot de supermarché."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9958167-f84f-4811-8c43-34655eb67292",
                                                "sense_id": "10d5ac95-9a9b-3264-b1dd-8346221e1133",
                                                "text": "Soudain, en passant devant une supérette, un caddie oublié devant la devanture du magasin inspira une idée à Nicolas."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d08b17c-9059-4945-a8ba-647a8db81722",
                                                "sense_id": "10d5ac95-9a9b-3264-b1dd-8346221e1133",
                                                "text": "Je me rappelle : Carrefour avenue de Genève à Annecy, où en mai 1968 nous avons rempli à ras bord un chariot – pas encore « caddie » – parce qu’on craignait la pénurie totale de vivres."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e2d63eb-0274-4c73-afb8-ee2bb6beb81b",
                                                "sense_id": "10d5ac95-9a9b-3264-b1dd-8346221e1133",
                                                "text": "Le caddie que j’ai pris à l’entrée du niveau 2 roule mal. Je m’aperçois qu’il est enfoncé sur un côté, la chaîne qui sert à l’attacher à un autre caddie a été arrachée. C’est un caddie qui a dû voyager hors du parking, servir à déménager ou jouer aux autos tamponneuses, etc. C’est fou tout ce qu’on peut faire sans doute avec un caddie. Je ne comprends pas pourquoi on ne les emprunte pas plus, pour un euro c’est une affaire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "72bdb397-be6b-3cfe-a3cd-f69ae9eb42c7",
                                        "entry_id": "f906dc6f-070c-38ef-a014-0db5645dfef9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Panier à provisions monté sur roulettes, chariot à provision."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
